[{"client_msg_id":"107c130f-e88d-4123-8762-bd29e754e06d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"使えるかちゃんと検証したいと思います。","ts":"1629793398.008500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9TtBS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2215ea69-81b5-4fbd-b4da-083b9a185250","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。その環境ヤバそうですね。","ts":"1629793339.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kR9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b34a24a-5300-49ac-91b2-040e63c9690a","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"複雑な認可を必要とするものを腕力で書けなかったし保守できる気もしなかった\nこれはロールベースを書いたものでこれは宣言的でいいんですが\n制約の中で権限ベースを検討したり...たり...たり\n知見みたいのは忘れたのでネガティブな印象しか覚えていません\n```create policy select_policy on data.shops for select to api\nusing (\n  ((request.user_role() = 'norole' or request.user_role() = 'webuser') and\n    id in (select shop_id from api.actors a inner join api.roles r on a.role_id = r.id where a.user_id = request.user_id()))\n  or\n  (request.user_role() = 'webuser' and\n    has_scope('USER', request.actor_id(), 'READ', 'shops') and\n    id = actor_shop(request.actor_id()))\n  or\n  (request.user_role() = 'webuser' and\n    has_scope('SHOP', request.actor_id(), 'READ', 'shops') and\n    id = actor_shop(request.actor_id()))\n  or\n  (request.user_role() = 'webuser' and\n    has_scope('CLIENT', request.actor_id(), 'READ', 'shops') and\n    client_id = actor_client(request.actor_id()))\n  or\n  (request.user_role() = 'webuser' and\n    has_scope('ALL', request.actor_id(), 'READ', 'shops'))\n);```\nデータのCRUDは行セキュリティポリシーとviewで書けます。\n認証とかCRUD以外の作用があるような処理はplpgsqlでなくともDBの関数として登録してあげる必要があります。\n\n\ngraphql対応は遅かったけれどもの自体はpostgrestのが先発じゃなかったかな?\n(当時の)subzero-starter-kitがフレームワークとしては洗練されていなくて\n一つview追加するために全体に1行とか書き加える必要があり\n保守無理だなと思ったり\n最初はsubzero-starter-kitもなかったので今はもっと良くなってると思います","ts":"1629793205.007700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IOuf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7005efea-1683-4de1-a7d8-cc2713c428b5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"plpgsqlガリガリ書くのはどういう場面で書かないといけなくなったんでしょう？","ts":"1629790436.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"awgk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0606b7d-7f89-426e-800a-7de346ad33d0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/PostgREST/postgrest\u003e\npostgrestこれですね。REST API版ですね。","ts":"1629788395.006800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"PostgREST/postgrest","id":1,"title":"PostgREST/postgrest","text":"REST API for any Postgres database","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://postgrest.org\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"17471","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2EFu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5f0cec6-ae5b-469a-93bf-82d56ee28345","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほどやっぱり大変なところ出てくるんですね。","ts":"1629788284.005800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8996edaa-1d94-49c4-9fef-b145d35ad13d","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"それ系のpostgrest触ってみたことあるけど行アクセス制御とplpgsqlガリガリ書くのしんどかった","ts":"1629788037.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GT+I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86cde67b-e951-465c-915e-120e7ac29428","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/ryo2132/items/999f7e6c8958a52d52d6\u003e\nhasunaという別のAPIサーバーもあるようです","ts":"1629786404.003300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: Hasuraで既存のPostgreSQLから爆速でGraphQL APIサーバーを構築する - Qiita","id":1,"title":"Hasuraで既存のPostgreSQLから爆速でGraphQL APIサーバーを構築する - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ryo2132/items/999f7e6c8958a52d52d6","text":"Hasuraで既存のPostgreSQLのDBから爆速で